{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07340","headline":"哭魏兼遂 · 刘长卿","name":"哭魏兼遂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古今俱此去，修短竟谁分。\n樽酒空如在，弦琴肯重闻。\n一门同逝水，万事共浮云。\n旧馆何人宅，空山远客坟。\n艰危贫且共，少小秀而文。\n独行依穷巷，全身出乱军。\n岁时长寂寞，烟月自氛氲。\n壠树随人古，山门对日曛。\n泛舟悲向子，留劒赠徐君。\n来去云阳路，伤心江水濆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07340.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07340","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}